# anzen.accept — accepted risks (copy to anzen.accept or point ACCEPT_FILE at it)
#
# One finding per line:  ID  YYYY-MM-DD  reason
# - ID comes from the reports (TXT "ID:" line, HTML under each finding,
#   JSON "id", SARIF partialFingerprints)
# - the date is mandatory: after it passes, the finding returns at its real
#   level with an "acceptance expired" note
# - accepted findings are reported as INFO and do not affect the score
